WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.941 --> 00:00:13.423
It was a spring morning.

2
00:00:14.904 --> 00:00:16.144
A woman was driving to work.

3
00:00:17.845 --> 00:00:19.965
"I hope I'm not late," she said.

4
00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:22.626
"I don't want to be fired!"

5
00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.847
The woman parked her car outside a construction site.

6
00:00:27.988 --> 00:00:29.148
She ran toward the gate.

7
00:00:31.692 --> 00:00:31.912
"Oh no!"

8
00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:32.432
said the woman.

9
00:00:32.453 --> 00:00:35.294
"I left my lunch in the car!"

10
00:00:37.476 --> 00:00:38.677
Suddenly the ground rumbled!

11
00:00:39.737 --> 00:00:46.362
A hole appeared, and the car began to The woman gasped.

12
00:00:46.382 --> 00:00:48.083
"My car!"

13
00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:53.506
Roxy and her friends were walking to soccer practice.

14
00:00:53.526 --> 00:00:57.549
"I love spring," said Jack.

15
00:00:57.569 --> 00:01:01.612
"That's because you love soccer," said Mara.

16
00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:02.881
Jack grinned.

17
00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:04.742
"I just like playing outside."

18
00:01:06.444 --> 00:01:08.526
"Who doesn't like playing outside?"

19
00:01:08.746 --> 00:01:09.466
Terrell asked.

20
00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:14.211
"I bet Rocket Girl is an awesome soccer player," said Jack.

21
00:01:15.271 --> 00:01:17.453
"Nobody could beat her," said Terrell.

22
00:01:18.374 --> 00:01:19.215
Mara smiled.

23
00:01:19.595 --> 00:01:22.398
"She could score even while playing goalie!"

24
00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:25.380
Terrell pretended to kick a ball.

25
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.504
"She could kick the ball past everyone."

26
00:01:30.944 --> 00:01:32.525
"Down the whole field!"

27
00:01:32.786 --> 00:01:33.366
said Jack.

28
00:01:33.386 --> 00:01:38.530
"It wouldn't be fair for Rocket Girl to play," said Roxy.

29
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.393
"She has super powers.

30
00:01:42.193 --> 00:01:43.935
Would you want to play against her?"

31
00:01:43.955 --> 00:01:47.077
"Rocket Girl would be on our team!"

32
00:01:47.257 --> 00:01:47.898
said Terrell.

33
00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.662
The four friends arrived at the school's soccer field.

34
00:01:52.682 --> 00:01:56.605
"Sorry, kids," Coach Nicole called out.

35
00:01:57.346 --> 00:01:58.126
She looked upset.

36
00:01:58.146 --> 00:01:59.808
"No practice today."

37
00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:01.473
Jack frowned.

38
00:02:01.693 --> 00:02:02.253
"Why not?"

39
00:02:02.273 --> 00:02:06.697
"It's so strange," Coach Nicole said, pointing behind her.

40
00:02:06.717 --> 00:02:08.999
"The equipment shed is missing.

41
00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:11.801
And all our soccer balls were inside."

42
00:02:11.822 --> 00:02:14.063
"Huh?" said Terrell.

43
00:02:15.144 --> 00:02:17.827
Roxy and her friends looked at the spot where the coach was pointing.

44
00:02:17.847 --> 00:02:20.529
"Whoa!" said Jack.

45
00:02:20.549 --> 00:02:22.891
"There's a big hole in the ground!"

46
00:02:22.911 --> 00:02:26.254
"It's a sinkhole," said the coach.

47
00:02:26.274 --> 00:02:28.816
"I guess the shed fell into it."

48
00:02:30.888 --> 00:02:31.648
Mara sighed.

49
00:02:31.668 --> 00:02:35.009
"Is there any way to get the shed back out?"

50
00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.430
"Rocket Girl could do it," said Terrell.

51
00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:43.392
"I think Rocket Girl has more important things to do," said Roxy.

52
00:02:43.412 --> 00:02:47.553
"She can't spend all day looking for the sinking shed."

53
00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:50.474
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

54
00:02:54.915 --> 00:02:57.096
She moved away from her friends and pressed a button.

55
00:03:01.484 --> 00:03:03.785
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said Mayor Bloom.

56
00:03:03.805 --> 00:03:07.407
"Sinkholes are appearing all over Metro City!"

57
00:03:07.427 --> 00:03:11.589
"A sinkhole appeared at the soccer field too," said Roxy.

58
00:03:11.609 --> 00:03:14.070
"The equipment shed sank into it."

59
00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:17.431
"You must do something," said the mayor.

60
00:03:17.451 --> 00:03:21.333
"All the vehicles at the new construction site are gone!"

61
00:03:21.353 --> 00:03:24.274
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

62
00:03:24.294 --> 00:03:27.376
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
